<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<TestCaseEntity>
   <description>Open the Express Interest modal, enter a message, cancel it, and verify the modal is removed while the opportunity's Submit Interest button remains available.</description>
   <name>TC_OM_024_ Verify Cancel button closes Express Interest modal</name>
   <tag>GenAI</tag>
   <comment>The Cancel action uses a runtime XPath scoped to the Express Interest dialog. The assertion now waits for the dialog to be removed from the DOM, which matches how the portal dismisses it.</comment>
   <recordOption>OTHER</recordOption>
   <testCaseGuid>fefb24ae-39ad-401a-a10d-d363a17411fd</testCaseGuid>
</TestCaseEntity>
